  "title": "Egg-Free and Milk-Free Baked Oatmeal",
  "description": "Baked oatmeal with no eggs and made with vegetable oil and soy milk. An egg-free and dairy-free recipe great for a vegan lifestyle or if you happen to be out of eggs!",
